flowchart TD
    A[💻 Accountant Logs In] --> B[🏠 Dashboard<br>Sees: Expenses, Reports, Bank Rec.]
    
    B --> C{Choose Action}
    
    C -->|Reconcile Bank| D1[📤 Upload Bank CSV]
    D1 --> D2[🧠 AI Auto-Matches Transactions]
    D2 --> D3[🔍 Manually Review Unmatched]
    D3 --> D4[✅ Reconciliation Complete]
    
    C -->|GST Filing| E1[📊 Open GST Reports]
    E1 --> E2[📋 View GSTR-1, 3B, 9]
    E2 --> E3[📤 Export JSON/Excel for CA]
    
    C -->|P&L / Balance Sheet| F1[📈 Select Date Range]
    F1 --> F2[📉 View Profit & Loss]
    F2 --> F3[📤 Export as PDF for Management]
    
    D4 --> G[🔚 End]
    E3 --> G
    F3 --> G
    
    note right of D1
        ✅ Can see Product Costs
        ✅ Can Delete Expenses
        ❌ Cannot Create Invoices
        ❌ Cannot see Employee Payroll
    end note
    
    style D2 fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b
    style E2 fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#b71c1c